* Technical concepts\nbehind the 2022 hacks
** Bridge message verification
*** Validator threshold and stale allowlist (Ronin)
*** Zero root accepted (Nomad)
*** Proof hash ignoring a field (BNB Chain)
*** Zero address as ETH (Qubit)
** Solana account validation
*** Fake sysvar account (Wormhole)
*** Unchecked collateral chain (Cashio)
** Governance and oracles
*** Flash-loaned voting power (Beanstalk)
*** Unrealised PnL as collateral (Mango)
*** Oracle price floor (LUNA, Venus, Blizz)
** Contract mechanics
*** Interaction before effects (Fei/Rari)
*** Proxy storage collision (Audius)
*** Upgradeable token minted by deployer key (Ankr)
** Keys and addresses
*** 32-bit seed vanity keys (Profanity, Wintermute)
*** CREATE address replay across chains (20M OP)
*** SIM swap, missing 2FA (FTX, Crypto.com)
